# postinst "triggered" whenever a package installs, reinstalls or removes this file, which loses its file capability
# then (security document 0.3.0, B2.4). noawait: the Intel tools never wait for orbitop. Comments only on lines of their
# own that start with "#": dpkg in trixie refuses a "#" after the directive.
interest-noawait /usr/bin/intel_gpu_top
